-- חוזר לבעלויות תשע"ד/10 — תגמול עובדי הוראה בגין הישגי בית הספר לשנת
-- הלימודים תשע"ד (21.8.2014)
-- The one-time grant for school year תשע"ד to upper-division teachers of
-- the schools whose achievements the Ministry found highest (section 36 of
-- the Oz LeTmura agreement): the amount by the school's rank, pro-rating,
-- what the grant is not part of, provident-fund contributions, payment in
-- August 2014 and reimbursement of the owners.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT common

§ `חוזר תשע"ד/10 תגמול בגין הישגי בית הספר תשע"ד`

-- akn:preamble The letterhead, title and date; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p8 Background: the general collective agreement of 14.8.2011 (the Oz LeTmura agreement); no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p9 Background: the agreement covers the reform and all upper-division teachers; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p10 States the purpose: the achievement grant for school year תשע"ד under section 36 of the agreement; the rules follow.

-- The school's rank, as the Ministry found it (2(ב)): one of the four
-- deciles, or none. The ranking itself follows the rules of the
-- Pedagogical Administration's letter of 21.10.2012 (2(א)), an input here.
DECLARE `school rank` IS ONE OF
    `rank 1, the highest 10%`
    `rank 2, the next 10%`
    `rank 3, the next 10%`
    `rank 4, the next 10%`
    `not ranked`

@desc A teaching employee's school year in an upper division, as the grant asks about it.
DECLARE `achievement year` HAS
    `graded as a teaching employee`   IS A BOOLEAN @desc graded in the teaching-employees grading, in the upper division
    `employed by a supervised owner`  IS A BOOLEAN @desc employed by an owner of post-primary education supervised by the Ministry
    `rank of the school`              IS A `school rank` @desc the rank the Ministry found for the school's achievements (letter of 21.10.2012)
    `upper-division fraction`         IS A NUMBER @desc the share of a position held in the upper division (1 = a full position)
    `months employed in the school`   IS A NUMBER @desc months of the school year employed in the excelling institution, maternity leave under the Women's Employment Law counted as employed
    `months in the school year`       IS A NUMBER @desc the months of the school year the period is measured against

DECLARE `grant action` IS ONE OF
    `pay the grant` HAS `grant paid` IS A NUMBER
    `reimburse the owner` HAS `reimbursed` IS A NUMBER

§§ `1. תחולה`

@ref akn:art_1/p1
GIVEN y IS AN `achievement year`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the circular applies to` y IF
        y's `graded as a teaching employee`
    AND y's `employed by a supervised owner`
    AND y's `upper-division fraction` GREATER THAN 0

§§ `2. תגמול בגין הישגי בית הספר`

-- 2(א): the program rewarding teachers for the (scholastic, social and
-- value) achievements of upper divisions (grades ט'-י"ב/י"ד in a four-year
-- school, י'-י"ב/י"ד in a three- or six-year school) is implemented from
-- תשע"ג, in the format and by the rules of the Pedagogical Administration's
-- letter of 21.10.2012 — those rules, and so the ranking, are an input.
@ref akn:art_2__para_a
GIVEN `school year` IS A NUMBER @desc the school year, by the year it ends in (תשע"ג = 2013)
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the achievement program is implemented in` `school year` IF
    `school year` AT LEAST 2013

-- 2(ב) and its table (the corpus gives its rows as lines ¶2-¶11): the
-- one-time grant for a teacher at 100% of a position, updated to May 2014
-- (¶12: by the consumer price index of May 2014 against May 2013).
@ref akn:art_2__para_b akn:art_2__para_b/p2 akn:art_2__para_b/p3 akn:art_2__para_b/p4 akn:art_2__para_b/p5 akn:art_2__para_b/p6 akn:art_2__para_b/p7 akn:art_2__para_b/p8 akn:art_2__para_b/p9 akn:art_2__para_b/p10 akn:art_2__para_b/p11 akn:art_2__para_b/p12
GIVEN r IS A `school rank`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the grant for a full position` r IS
    CONSIDER r
    WHEN `rank 1, the highest 10%` THEN 8285.87
    WHEN `rank 2, the next 10%`    THEN 6214.40
    WHEN `rank 3, the next 10%`    THEN 4142.93
    WHEN `rank 4, the next 10%`    THEN 3107.20
    WHEN `not ranked`              THEN 0

-- 2(ב): the teachers entitled are those of the upper divisions whose
-- achievements the Ministry examined and found highest.
GIVEN y IS AN `achievement year`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the school was found among the highest` y IF
    NOT y's `rank of the school` EQUALS `not ranked`

-- The four amounts stand to one another as 8 : 6 : 4 : 3, one index
-- update applied to all (¶12); checked to a tenth of a percent.
#ASSERT TRUNC ((`the grant for a full position` `rank 2, the next 10%` DIVIDED BY `the grant for a full position` `rank 1, the highest 10%`) TIMES 1000 PLUS 0.5) 0 EQUALS 750
#ASSERT TRUNC ((`the grant for a full position` `rank 3, the next 10%` DIVIDED BY `the grant for a full position` `rank 1, the highest 10%`) TIMES 1000 PLUS 0.5) 0 EQUALS 500
#ASSERT TRUNC ((`the grant for a full position` `rank 4, the next 10%` DIVIDED BY `the grant for a full position` `rank 1, the highest 10%`) TIMES 1000 PLUS 0.5) 0 EQUALS 375

-- 2(ג): a part-time teacher, or one employed for part of the year
-- (unpaid leave and sabbatical included; maternity leave counted as
-- employed, but not unpaid leave after it), gets the proportional part by
-- the upper-division fraction and/or the part of the year תשע"ד. 2(ד), and
-- again 2(ז) ¶2: employment above 100% is not counted.
@ref akn:art_2__para_c akn:art_2__para_d akn:art_2__para_g/p2
GIVEN y IS AN `achievement year`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the proportional part` y IS
    min (y's `upper-division fraction`) 1
    TIMES min 1 (y's `months employed in the school` DIVIDED BY y's `months in the school year`)

@export default The one-time school-achievement grant for school year תשע"ד under circular תשע"ד/10
GIVEN y IS AN `achievement year` @desc the teacher's school year
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `achievement grant` y IS
    IF `the circular applies to` y AND `the school was found among the highest` y AND `the achievement program is implemented in` 2014
    THEN `the grant for a full position` (y's `rank of the school`) TIMES `the proportional part` y
    ELSE 0

-- 2(ו): not part of the base for the hour value, severance pay or
-- percentage supplements, and no training-fund contributions on it.
DECLARE `computation` IS ONE OF
    `the hour value`
    `severance pay`
    `percentage supplements`
    `training-fund contributions`
    `provident-fund contributions for a pension`

@ref akn:art_2__para_f akn:art_2__para_g
GIVEN c IS A `computation`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the grant counts for` c IF
    c EQUALS `provident-fund contributions for a pension`

-- 2(ז): provident-fund contributions at 5% employer and 5% deducted from
-- the teacher's salary.
@ref akn:art_2__para_g
`the employer's contribution rate` MEANS 5%
`the teacher's contribution rate`  MEANS 5%

GIVEN y IS AN `achievement year`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the employer's contribution on the grant` y IS
    `the employer's contribution rate` TIMES `achievement grant` y

-- 2(ה): the grants are paid with the salary of August 2014. Time in school
-- months (September 2013 = 1, August 2014 = 12).
@ref akn:art_2__para_e
GIVEN y IS AN `achievement year`
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `grant action`
DECIDE `the grant paid with August's salary` y IS
    PARTY `the employer`
    MUST  `pay the grant` amount PROVIDED amount AT LEAST `achievement grant` y
    WITHIN `month number` August
    LEST  BREACH BY `the employer` BECAUSE "circular תשע\"ד/10, 2(ה): the grants are paid with the salary of August 2014"

-- akn:art_3 A link to circular תשע"ג/11 with the program and the list of winning schools; the list is the input `rank of the school`.
-- akn:art_3/p2 The link's title ("פירוט תכנית התגמול"); no rule.
-- akn:art_3/p3 The link's title (the list of schools for תשע"ד); the list is the input `rank of the school`.

-- 4: reimbursement to the owners in the payments system (subject 583), in
-- the August 2014 payments transferred at the start of 9/2014 (month 13).
@ref akn:art_4
GIVEN y IS AN `achievement year`
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `grant action`
DECIDE `the owner reimbursed in the August payments` y IS
    PARTY `the Ministry of Education`
    MUST  `reimburse the owner` amount PROVIDED amount AT LEAST `achievement grant` y
    WITHIN 13
    LEST  BREACH BY `the Ministry of Education` BECAUSE "circular תשע\"ד/10, section 4: reimbursement in the August 2014 payments (subject 583), transferred early 9/2014"

-- akn:art_4/p2 akn:art_4/p3 The contact line for questions; no rule.
-- akn:conclusions The greeting and the signature; no rule.

§§ `Worked examples`

-- The teachers are illustrations.
`a full-time teacher in a rank-1 school` MEANS
    `achievement year` WITH
        `graded as a teaching employee`  IS TRUE
        `employed by a supervised owner` IS TRUE
        `rank of the school`             IS `rank 1, the highest 10%`
        `upper-division fraction`        IS 1.2
        `months employed in the school`  IS 12
        `months in the school year`      IS 12

`a half-time teacher for half the year in a rank-3 school` MEANS
    `achievement year` WITH
        `graded as a teaching employee`  IS TRUE
        `employed by a supervised owner` IS TRUE
        `rank of the school`             IS `rank 3, the next 10%`
        `upper-division fraction`        IS 0.5
        `months employed in the school`  IS 6
        `months in the school year`      IS 12

#ASSERT `achievement grant` `a full-time teacher in a rank-1 school` EQUALS 8285.87
#ASSERT `achievement grant` `a half-time teacher for half the year in a rank-3 school` EQUALS 1035.7325
#ASSERT NOT `the grant counts for` `training-fund contributions`
#EVAL   `the employer's contribution on the grant` `a full-time teacher in a rank-1 school`

#TRACE `the grant paid with August's salary` `a full-time teacher in a rank-1 school` AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `the employer` DOES `pay the grant` 8285.87 AT 12
#TRACE `the owner reimbursed in the August payments` `a full-time teacher in a rank-1 school` AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `the Ministry of Education` DOES `reimburse the owner` 8285.87 AT 13
